      "side": 1,
      "message": "This CL is piping a ton of complexity through `LinkableInterface`, and the end result seems to be sharing a relatively small amount of code.  I think the goal here should be to reuse code that is in functions like the ones in `builder.go`, and not the ones that are part of `libraryDecorator`.  If you want to reuse this code, make it take everything it needs as inputs and return what it produces rather than calling back through the `ctx` via `LinkableInterface`.",
      "revId": "e93496ed92f962131c32c50c9770477ea78d0d9d",
